// Faint washes for diff lines - a tint behind normally-highlighted code, not
// a colour of its own. 24-bit, because the 256-colour cube has no green or
// red darker than 22/52, which read as solid bars; a terminal without
// truecolour ignores these and shows the line with no wash, which is fine.
// @compiler replace: packages/darklang/stdlib/cli/ui/colors.dark#Darklang.Stdlib.Cli.UI.Colors.faintGreenBg reason=compiler-implementation
val faintGreenBg = "\x1b[48;2;24;44;30m"
// @compiler replace: packages/darklang/stdlib/cli/ui/colors.dark#Darklang.Stdlib.Cli.UI.Colors.faintRedBg reason=compiler-implementation
val faintRedBg = "\x1b[48;2;52;28;32m"

